@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Index";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_UserSideLayout.cshtml";
}

<div class="container p-5" style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; margin-top:30px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Computer Support – Keep Your Digital Life Running Smoothly</h1>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                You consider your computer as the heart of your digital universe. It plays an important role in managing and processing information, connecting with family, and storing data. But what if, for a change, your device starts to act up? You might be left in uncertainty due to a slow-performing machine, random freezing, or problems with software rendering. Such issues can interfere with your everyday activities and turn the easiest of things into a source of irritation.
            </p>
            <br />
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Common Computer Issues We Solve:</h2>
            <ul style="font-size: 18px; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Does launching your computer take ages? Indeed, slow boot times can be caused by two aspects: the bloat of application software or declining hardware components.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do you have difficulty installing or updating software? Compatibility issues and unsuccessful installations are rather frequent yet manageable.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Have you experienced any sudden notifications or unusual behavior on your screen? Some viruses or malware may have infiltrated your device.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Struggling to remember your password? It's a common problem, but there's no need to panic; we will help you regain access as soon as possible.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you afraid of losing all your information? There’s no need for you to worry because data backup and recovery help to keep files safe even with all the hardware failures one may encounter.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">How TechValet Helps You:</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                We pay attention to detail in the resolution of technical problems. Whether it involves a virus, optimizing performance, or helping you with backup solutions, you can expect our team to be with you every step of the way.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Call to Action Section -->
<div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding:20px">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Feel free to utilize your computer today without any difficulties.</h3>
    <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #555;">Call TechValet Computer Support for fast and reliable service.</p>
    <a href="@Url.Action("Contact","Home")" style="background-color: #E48F01; color: #fff; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 18px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 20px; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#E48F01'">
        Call Us Now
    </a>
</div>
